== Overview ==
The '''Ultra Laser Toilet''' is an [[Enemies|enemy]] from the [[Episode 67 Part 4 Update|Episode 67 (Part 4) Update]]. Its lasers will all target one [[Units|unit]] and stun it for 5 seconds (unless you have a healing unit). It has 1.2M health. The Ultra Laser Toilet is also seen in [[Nightmare Mode]], and it is recommended to have [[Legendary]] or [[Mythic]][[Godly|+]] to beat it.
== Appearance ==
The Ultra Laser Toilet has a similar appearance to the [[Boss Toilet 4.0]], with the exception of it having a diamond plate in the middle, eleven lasers, a yellow shirt instead of the regular blue, and a jetpack. It has a grey toilet and shades aswell.

== Waves ==
TBA

== Abilities ==
It can stun units with it's lasers.

== Strategy ==
Use an unstun [[Units|unit]] as it stuns for a long time, and have a good damage unit. It has lots of health, so you should bring a slowing unit to prevent losing the game.

